<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>MYTRIP — Entrar</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
<style>
.auth-page{min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg,#f4f8f8);padding:40px 20px}.auth-card{width:min(520px,100%);background:var(--card,#fff);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:22px;padding:38px;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(45,80,85,.12)}.auth-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--primary);font-size:1.55rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:28px}.auth-brand .brand-icon{width:42px;height:42px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:12px;background:var(--primary);color:#fff}.auth-card h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:2rem}.auth-desc{color:var(--text-muted);margin:0 0 26px}.auth-field{margin-bottom:16px}.auth-field label{display:block;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:7px}.auth-field input{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}.auth-btn{width:100%;margin-top:8px}.auth-switch{text-align:center;color:var(--text-muted);margin:22px 0 0}.auth-switch button{border:0;background:none;color:var(--primary);font:inherit;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.auth-message{min-height:20px;color:#c45b5b;font-size:.9rem;margin:12px 0 0}.auth-hidden{display:none!important}
</style>
</head>
<body class="auth-page" data-page="login">
<main class="auth-card">
<div class="auth-brand"><div class="brand-icon">✈</div><span>MYTRIP</span></div>
<section id="login-section"><h1>Bem-vinda de volta!</h1><p class="auth-desc">Entre para continuar registrando suas viagens.</p><form id="login-form"><div class="auth-field"><label for="login-email">E-mail</label><input type="email" id="login-email" class="form-control" placeholder="Digite seu e-mail" required></div><div class="auth-field"><label for="login-password">Senha</label><input type="password" id="login-password" class="form-control" placeholder="Digite sua senha" required></div><button class="btn btn-primary auth-btn" type="submit">Entrar</button></form><p class="auth-message" id="login-message"></p><p class="auth-switch">Ainda não possui uma conta? <button type="button" id="show-register">Criar uma conta</button></p></section>
<section id="register-section" hidden><h1>Criar sua conta</h1><p class="auth-desc">Guarde suas viagens e memórias em um só lugar.</p><form id="register-form"><div class="auth-field"><label for="register-name">Nome</label><input type="text" id="register-name" class="form-control" placeholder="Seu nome" required></div><div class="auth-field"><label for="register-email">E-mail</label><input type="email" id="register-email" class="form-control" placeholder="Seu e-mail" required></div><div class="auth-field"><label for="register-password">Senha</label><input type="password" id="register-password" class="form-control" minlength="6" placeholder="Mínimo de 6 caracteres" required></div><div class="auth-field"><label for="register-confirm">Confirmar senha</label><input type="password" id="register-confirm" class="form-control" placeholder="Digite novamente" required></div><button class="btn btn-primary auth-btn" type="submit">Criar conta</button></form><p class="auth-message" id="register-message"></p><p class="auth-switch">Já possui uma conta? <button type="button" id="show-login">Voltar para o login</button></p></section>
</main><script src="script.js"></script>
</body></html>